DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
42674::$$$message_0346_0000_0000$$$::"Welcome to the Delusional Onsen, Brother.[lr]::
42675::$$$message_0346_0000_0001$$$::I'm Dark Sakura, the spirit of these hot springs."::
42676::$$$message_0346_0000_0002$$$::"Did you lose something? The Shinji Matou route, perhaps? Or was it your dignity as a rival character?"::
42677::$$$message_0346_0000_0003$$$::"Oh, it's you, Sakura. [se storage=se060.wav]Next."::
42678::$$$message_0346_0000_0004$$$::"Grr... Just be cool, Sakura..."::
42679::$$$message_0346_0001_0000$$$::"Don't get mad... You went to the trouble of playing the fairy, so be small, cute, and modest... [wait canskip=0 time=500][hfstopquake][hffacechg chara=黒桜 face=楽 layer=0 time=200][sestop time=3000 nowait=1][fadebgm time=3000 volume=100]Okay. [wait canskip=0 time=200][hfsigh layer=0]Yes. [wait canskip=0 time=200]Cool."::
42680::$$$message_0346_0001_0001$$$::"Um, let me start over."::
42681::$$$message_0346_0002_0000$$$::"Did you lose your illicit love for a high-handed schoolmate? Or your love for your lovely little sister?"::
42682::$$$message_0346_0002_0001$$$::"I don't want any of those. [hffacechg chara=慎二 face=哀 layer=1 time=200][hfchance layer=1]Damn, you're as stupid as ever. All you can think of is love this, love that. Is your Japanese skill at rank E?"::
42683::$$$message_0346_0002_0002$$$::"Nngh...!"::
42684::$$$message_0346_0003_0000$$$::"I-it's alliteration! [hfangry layer=0]I'm trying to keep a consistent theme!"::
42685::$$$message_0346_0003_0001$$$::"Ah ha ha. Don't bother."::
42686::$$$message_0346_0003_0002$$$::"And what's this about being tiny?[lr]::
42687::$$$message_0346_0003_0003$$$::A diet at this point won't do anything to shrink that overnourished chest."::
42688::$$$message_0346_0003_0004$$$::"......Ah..."::
42689::$$$message_0346_0003_0005$$$::"Calm down, Sakura.[lr]::
42690::$$$message_0346_0003_0006$$$::It's just Shinji being Shinji. He doesn't particularly mean anything malic[line len=2]"[wvs][nolr]::
42691::$$$message_0346_0003_0007$$$::"Hey, the telephone pole's here, too.[lr]::
42692::$$$message_0346_0003_0008$$$::I wouldn't order a couple of rejects like you even on a good day."::
42693::$$$message_0346_0004_0000$$$::"I need my girls to be [font italic=true]balanced[font italic=false], you dig me?"[skip_next_tag][br]::
42694::$$$message_0346_0004_0001$$$::"T-telephone pole..."::
42695::$$$message_0346_0004_0002$$$::"O-[hfchance layer=0][wvs][wait canskip=0 time=400][say storage=HSIN6_KSK_0180 _name=黒桜]oh, no! [wait canskip=0 time=400][l][hffacechg chara=黒桜 face=哀 layer=0 time=200][hfwww layer=0][say storage=HSIN6_KSK_0190 _name=黒桜]That's not what he meant, Rider! He must be talking about something else that's electric! You know, like a cute little animal..."::
42697::$$$message_0346_0004_0004$$$::"Well, look at you two, all buddy-buddy. Keep doing that. I got business up ahead, not with my gloomy little sister."::
42698::$$$message_0346_0004_0005$$$::"...I can't believe this.[lr]::
42699::$$$message_0346_0004_0006$$$::He actually ignored us, the sexiest women in Fuyuki!"::
42700::$$$message_0346_0004_0007$$$::"Let's murder him. [wait canskip=0 time=400] [lr][say storage=HSIN6_RAD_0050 _name=ライダー][font italic=true]Right now[font italic=false], Sakura."::
42701::$$$message_0346_0004_0008$$$::"...Time for a role change.[lr]::
42702::$$$message_0346_0004_0009$$$::Big Brother, it's time to beg for your life for all the evils you've done!"::
42703::$$$message_0346_0004_0010$$$::"Now that's what I call a load of POPPYCOCK!"::
42704::$$$message_0346_0005_0000$$$::"You're so dense. Blood sisters lack [font italic=true]moe[font italic=false], y'know? If that makes you mad, then go be reborn as my foster sister!"::
42705::$$$message_0346_0005_0001$$$::"She is your foster sister, though..."::

